extends ui_layout

block styles
  link(type='text/css', rel='stylesheet', href='/public/css/com.css')

block content
  .sixteen.wide.column.centered#com
    .ui.card
      .com-header
        h1 FreshView Community Guidelines
      .com-content
        p <strong style="color: black;">FreshView</strong> is built on two simple ideas: authentic sharing and honest feedback. People come here to share real moments from everyday life—food, questions, opinions—and to get honest perspectives from others.
        h2 Help Keep FreshView Kind
        p Our moderators can't be everywhere — that's where you come in. If you spot something that violates the following guidelines, <strong>Flag It 🚩</strong> so we can investigate, or <strong>respond with care</strong>. A little thoughtfulness goes a long way.
        h3.left-align No Personal Attacks and Bullying
        p Zero tolerance on attacking or harassing others based on their identity, appearance, gender, or personal expressions! FreshView is a place for authentic sharing, not to tear each other down.
        h3.left-align No Racism, sexism, and other discrimination
        p Attacking entire classes of people is just like attacking a single person: we'll ban you for it.
        h3.left-align No NSFW material
        p If you wouldn't show your boss, don't show it here!
        p We appreciate your efforts in helping shape the tone of the platform.
        .com-footer-content
          img.com-logo(src='/public/favicon.svg', alt='FreshView Logo')
          .com-enter
            a.ui.large.primary.button(href='/') Back to Feed
